---
import PageShell from '../../../layouts/PageShell.astro';

const seoTitle = 'Consultation CTA Examples | Med Spa Marketing Guide';
const seoDesc =
	'Starter CTA overlays balancing clarity, pacing, and disclaimers—you must localize copy with counsel-reviewed medical advertising rules.';
---

<PageShell title={seoTitle} description={seoDesc}>
	<h1>Consultation CTA starters (editable)</h1>
	<p>Copy should answer: what happens next, expected duration boundaries, billing transparency—all without diagnosing online.</p>
	<h2>Primary button labels</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>“Book a skincare consult · 360° candidacy discussion” — pairs aspiration with clinician gatekeeping.</li>
		<li>“Talk with our injectables educator” — better than hypey “Glow now” gimmicks.</li>
	</ul>
	<h2>Secondary reassurance snippets</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>“We’ll clarify whether you’re evaluating toxins, fillers, lasers, or a combined plan.”</li>
		<li>“You can reschedule without penalty until [policy link].”</li>
	</ul>
	<p>
		<strong>Note:</strong>
		swap tone for brand—but never promise clinical outcomes inside CTA verbs.
	</p>
</PageShell>
